WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.059 --> 00:00:11.490
This is my cell phone, okay?

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:25.109
Does that look like that is the cell phone
case of a liberal?

00:00:25.109 --> 00:00:28.240
My dad is a retired baptist minister.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:34.980
He told me that in order to get people to
hear your message, you have to get them in

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.220
the church.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:43.660
That is a mistake that a lot of environmentalists
make when talking to Republicans and conservatives

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:46.250
about solar, about clean energy.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.720
They lead off with climate change.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.500
That is the wrong message.

00:00:51.500 --> 00:01:01.170
If you deliver the message of energy freedom,
energy choice, competition, national security,

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.449
innovation —

00:01:02.449 --> 00:01:08.320
all of the sudden you have a receptive audience
and they will listen to you.

00:01:08.320 --> 00:01:15.850
If you lead off with climate change, they're
not going to pay a bit of attention to anything

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:16.920
else you say.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:24.720
They've been brainwashed for decades into
believing we're not damaging the environment.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:33.429
Unfortunately, a lot of these fossil fuel
interests and giant monopolies have been telling

00:01:33.429 --> 00:01:39.310
activists for decades that we're not damaging
the environment…

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:45.609
Everyone agrees that burning fossil fuels
releases carbon dioxide, and that such concentrations

00:01:45.609 --> 00:01:47.509
in the atmosphere are rising.

00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:55.229
But it’s a long and dangerous leap to conclude
that we should therefore cut fossil fuel use.

00:01:55.229 --> 00:02:03.189
You have industries that have a lot of money
in deep pockets and they're willing to use

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:11.060
that money to put out negative facts and bogus
studies to convince us that renewables are

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.060
bad.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:16.500
Get the facts about these out-of-state solar
companies at AZSolarFacts.com

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.370
And by God, they are not going to get away
with it.

00:02:19.370 --> 00:02:28.290
You have to understand one thing: The Republican
party has always been, in the past, a party

00:02:28.290 --> 00:02:30.030
of conservation.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:37.990
Richard Nixon, a Republican president, actually
created the EPA to make sure we had clean

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:39.820
air and clean water.

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:45.709
Each of us all across this great land has
a stake in maintaining and improving environmental

00:02:45.709 --> 00:02:46.709
quality.

00:02:46.709 --> 00:02:51.500
Ronald Reagan is not actually known as an
environmental president.

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.560
But he was a conservationist.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:03:01.970
He actually believed man was damaging the
environment and he advocated very strongly

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:08.110
for and signed the Montreal Protocol that
banned fluorocarbons.

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:15.000
If Ronald Reagan were alive today and he wanted
to ban aerosols, fluorocarbons, because he

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:21.550
saw scientific evidence that they were damaging
the environment, some of these same groups

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:27.900
that are attacking renewables would be attacking
the conservative icon Ronald Reagan.

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:33.829
One of the reasons I’m fighting very hard
to bring conservatives on board and to educate

00:03:33.829 --> 00:03:40.140
conservatives to advance renewables: Failure
is not an option.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:42.830
This earth is not a Republican earth.

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:45.390
It’s not a Democrat earth.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:48.120
This earth belongs to all of us.

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:55.170
If you think fossil fuel is not damaging the
environment, pull your car in a garage, start

00:03:55.170 --> 00:04:01.610
up your engine and inhale the exhaust fumes
for a few minutes and see what happens.

